generation_chain.prompt:
Perform the final measured edit to the current six-character Grok Bot family group, using R01 as the source of proportions, arrangement and character order. Preserve the same six identities, vivid colors, polished material, capsule eyes, and forward-facing view. Keep the broad group width essentially unchanged while independently reducing the oversized figures.

SCALE THESE CURRENT CHARACTERS ABOUT THIS MUCH:
- green cloud: 80% of its current width and height;
- blue teardrop: 85%;
- purple rounded triangle: 80%;
- red rounded hexagon: 85%;
- teal rounded square: 90%;
- orange bean: 90%.
Scale each individual character around its own center. Do not scale the whole group uniformly. Preserve each distinct geometric silhouette.

POSITION CORRECTIONS on the 1536px-wide native image:
- move the blue teardrop's center about 20 native pixels toward the left;
- move the red hexagon's center about 20 native pixels toward the right;
- retain the current overall group width after the size reductions by leaving the small figures distributed across the same broad horizontal span;
- keep cloud upper-center, orange bean behind-left, blue drop front-left, teal square front-center, purple triangle behind-right, red hex front-right.
- Make more of the orange bean visible between the cloud and front row; keep both orange eyes clear.
- Make the purple triangle clearly a smaller rear-right accent peeking above/behind the red hexagon.
- The cloud stays near the top-center and remains visibly cloud-shaped; it must no longer dominate the group.
- Keep the red hex and the teal square distinct, adjacent, and not covered.

Maintain a close, playful R01-style interlock with visible depth and slightly breathable contours. Avoid both a tightly crushed single blob and a neat straight row. Keep all six faces fully readable. Use the exact six R01 color/shape roles: vivid green multi-lobed cloud, warm orange bean, bright blue drop, teal rounded square, purple rounded triangle, berry-red rounded hexagon.

Every figure has exactly two white capsule eyes with the same slight diagonal slant. No other facial features. Smooth glossy-soft silicone/vinyl, controlled bright studio highlights, refined saturation, no plush or fuzzy material. Keep transparent background and full silhouettes, no external color glow, no halo, no background, floor, UI, labels, or text. Do not add or remove a character.
